# Netlify custom headers for the marketing site (audit 2026-09-26, M35).
# Rules match the REQUEST path, so every clean URL from _redirects is listed explicitly.
# /careers, /portal, /api, /assets, /uploads, /logos are proxied to Filament, which sets its
# own headers, so they are deliberately not matched.
# No CSP yet: every page carries an inline <script> and onclick handlers, so a CSP would need
# 'unsafe-inline' and buy nothing until those are moved to a file.

/
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()

